{"c":[{"name":"20261008T143933Z-2d2e0e57729d25b3","text":"realfill-asks seals each request before the canned oracle answers it, so FillTrace.owns(req) is false there: the oracle reads fill questions by their text on the scoreboard but by the trace in the vs1 kit (runB31). Don't make oracle rules depend on the trace.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T143933Z-70fb13e0b1aaff9c","text":"v2/choices: a source-supported choice needs its whole unit sent; a TextEdit note never fits an Ask that does not name it (prose share keeps half back), so only Asks naming the source window get unit-based choices. The user's request is always a basis.","type":"note"}]}
